  data: {
    LLM: 'Players play 7 or 11 rounds. Each round has a contract (specific sets and runs). Each turn: draw one from stock or buy from discard (La Pige; 2-card penalty), fulfill the round contract then expand melds, discard one card. First to empty hand wins the round; remaining hands are scored. Lowest aggregate score after all rounds wins.',
    Player: 'Players play 7 or 11 rounds. Each round has a contract (specific sets and runs). Each turn: draw one from stock or buy from discard (La Pige; 2-card penalty), fulfill the round contract then expand melds, discard one card. First to empty hand wins the round; remaining hands are scored. Lowest aggregate score after all rounds wins.',
    objective: "Complete the round's contract and be the first to reach zero cards. Lowest aggregate score wins.",
    gameplay: 'Players play 7 or 11 rounds. Each round has a contract (specific sets and runs). Each turn: draw one from stock or buy from discard (La Pige; 2-card penalty), fulfill the round contract then expand melds, discard one card. First to empty hand wins the round; remaining hands are scored. Lowest aggregate score after all rounds wins.',
    keyRules: [
      'Each round has a contract (sets and runs); fulfill it before expanding melds.',
      'Draw one from stock or buy from discard (La Pige; then draw two extra from stock).',
      'Meld and lay off on any meld; discard one card to end turn.',
      'First to empty hand wins the round; lowest aggregate score after all rounds wins.',
